{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，个别段落里X的感受句偏长，纯扫视速度不如Y右侧短词块利落。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X把每段的关键转折直接放大，而且“话—感受”贴着出现、部分感受还延后到音乐对应处才出来，所以几秒内更容易先抓住发生了什么，再顺手接到为什么会这样。Y的左栏叙事本身不差，但右边大量短词同时铺开，很多词彼此抢注意力，甚至会把细腻的摇摆压成较粗的情绪标签；X因此更容易把从靠近、收住、被看穿、重新安心，到接受无法保证未来这一整条线连起来。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4eddf717-9def-4e19-b82c-b43e54bac743", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T030806993536Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:08:18.052788+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b65228d539ab28c893fc53f995e936388077f8d68dde712709706c724865da72", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence"